            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 2 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/side-article-2.jpg" alt="Top real estate agent reviewing documents at a modern desk with smartphone, coffee, and natural lighting" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Detailed Review: BirkyStudio -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:32px;">Detailed Reviews</h2>

      <div id="birky-studio" style="background:rgba(129,140,248,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(129,140,248,0.3);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <span style="background:#818cf8;color:white;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">BEST VALUE</span>
          <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0;">BirkyStudio</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio installs a custom AI agent that handles the front-desk work of your real estate business. It answers phone calls through Vapi, runs full AI-powered conversations on WhatsApp, qualifies leads, schedules showings, searches properties, manages your email inbox, drafts listing descriptions, and follows up with past clients — all in English and Spanish. You don't manage a platform; you just tell the AI what you need and it does the work.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          The key difference from Side: BirkyStudio doesn't change your business structure. You keep your current brokerage, your current brand, and your current commission split. You just add an AI that handles the conversations you're missing. Setup takes 2-3 hours in a guided screen share session, and the AI is trained on your specific listings, your process, and your lead types.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Because BirkyStudio is a fixed-cost service ($1,297 one-time plus optional $29/month support), it works for agents at any production level — from brand-new agents to top producers who just want to stop answering the same questions all day. There's no minimum volume, no commission split, and no restructuring.
        </p>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">✅ Pros</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>No learning curve — AI does the work, you don't manage it</li>
              <li>Custom-trained on your listings and processes</li>
              <li>WhatsApp + phone + email in one setup</li>
              <li>Bilingual (EN/ES) included by default</li>
              <li>Fixed one-time cost, no commission split</li>
              <li>Works with any brokerage — no restructuring needed</li>
              <li>No minimum production threshold</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>No transaction management or compliance support</li>
              <li>No payments, back office, or brokerage infrastructure</li>
              <li>No brand ownership — you remain under your current brokerage</li>
              <li>Smaller team, less brand recognition</li>
              <li>Not designed for building a multi-agent company</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;">
          Pricing: AI Agent Setup $1,297 one-time · WhatsApp Receptionist $297 · Voice Receptionist $550 + Vapi (~$30-50/mo) · Optional support from $29/month
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 3 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/side-article-3.jpg" alt="Real estate agent working remotely with laptop and smartphone at a coffee shop, warm lighting" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Detailed Review: Side -->
      <div id="side" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Side</h3>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Side is a real estate brokerage platform that lets top-producing agents own their own companies. Rather than joining a traditional brokerage or franchise, Side partners become the broker of their own boutique brand — Side handles all the back-office operations: compliance, payments, transaction coordination, agent support, and the technology platform (SideOS) that runs it all.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          What makes Side unique is the depth of its infrastructure. Over 600 partner companies run on Side, collectively doing $135B+ in annual volume. Side's compliance team reviews every file. 85% of agents get paid the same day they close. The Side App puts the entire brokerage in every agent's pocket — offers, documents, signatures, payments, and live reporting. Side AI handles repetitive transaction-level work behind the scenes. The result: agents save 4-6 hours per transaction, and partners grow 44% on average after switching.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          However, Side is not for every agent. The platform targets top producers — their lead form starts at "Less than $2M" annual volume and goes up to $50M+. They don't publish pricing; it's a consultation-based partnership with a fee structure tied to your production. You also need to be a licensed real estate agent in the US, and you're essentially launching a new brokerage — which comes with real responsibility, even with Side handling the back office. And critically, Side does not offer AI for lead conversations, WhatsApp, or phone calls — that's where BirkyStudio fills the gap.
        </p>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">✅ Pros</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>You own your own brokerage company and brand</li>
              <li>Full transaction management — contract to close</li>
              <li>Dedicated compliance team reviews every file</li>
              <li>85% of agents paid same-day on close</li>
              <li>SideOS app + Side AI for transaction automation</li>
              <li>44% average volume growth after switching</li>
              <li>Community of 600+ top-producing companies</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="color:white;font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-bottom:8px;">⚠️ Cons</p>
            <ul style="color:#cbd5e1;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
              <li>No public pricing — consultation-based, tied to production</li>
              <li>Requires top-producing agent status ($2M+ volume)</li>
              <li>No AI for lead conversations, WhatsApp, or phone calls</li>
              <li>Weeks to months to set up (compliance + onboarding)</li>
              <li>You must be a licensed US real estate agent</li>
              <li>Launching a brokerage carries legal and regulatory responsibility</li>
              <li>Not available for agents who want to stay at their current brokerage</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;">
          Pricing: Not published — consultation only · Requires $2M+ annual production · Fee structure based on commission splits · Free initial consultation
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cost Comparison -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">Cost Comparison — 12 Month View</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid #818cf8;">
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;">Scenario</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;">BirkyStudio (Year 1)</th>
              <th style="text-align:left;padding:14px 12px;color:#818cf8;font-weight:600;">Side (Year 1)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Solo agent, basic setup</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">$1,297 (one-time, no support)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Not published — consultation only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Solo agent with AI support + WhatsApp</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">~$1,645 (setup + $29/mo support)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Not published — consultation only</td>
